      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to expedite these procedures, arrangements have been made for a meeting of the heads and delegated representatives of all departments and agencies on Tuesday, May 26, 1953 at 11:00 A. M. in the Mayor's Reception Room at City Hall, which I plan to address on the subject of classification and compensation in our civil service.",
